    "text": "If a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;lies in the region bounded by the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis, straight lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math>, then the probability that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is"
