  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Plotting the diagram of the given straight line we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0100_1536572c3a2f.png\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 193px;\" /></p><p>Now by diagram, required probability&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>ar</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>ar</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>ar</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>ar</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
